Author: arigandores <arigandores@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Wed Sep 23 01:43:24 2026 +0200

    Session 103: BVH loop cap (default ON for 380bb9d6), 15 translator env sites read their value, KYTY_BDA_LEAN (M5', default off)
    
    KYTY_BVH_LOOP_CAP: one 65536-step budget per invocation for KYTY_BVH_LOOP_CAP_SET
    (default {380bb9d636390bae}); a trip counts bl_trip in the fault-buffer tail and returns
    through the normal return path; normal returns past 1/16 of the budget count bl_near.
    Overrides carry a signature token and their own cache directory.
    KYTY_BDA_LEAN: measurement-only BDA path (no PS fault store, one table read per lookup,
    read-only PSB views, uvec4 windows behind a run-time alignment test). Off: byte-identical
    SPIR-V for every offline-recompilable cached module (106 CS, 173 PS).
    Built as 16ef56b6 (emulator) from this tree.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

